OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain spreading southeast in the
OL,6,Fmorning, heavy initially in the west
OL,7,Fbut lighter in the east. Then turning
OL,8,Fdrier and brighter with just a few
OL,9,Flight showers. Strong winds easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA mainly dry and bright
OL,12,Fevening with perhaps just the odd
OL,13,Flight shower. Cloud and outbreaks of
OL,14,Frain then spread east, the rain heavy
OL,15,Fat times in the west.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FMainly cloudy with rain in the
OL,18,Fmorning, turning more showery in the
OL,19,Fafternoon with some bright or sunny
OL,20,Fspells developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
