OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FAn
OL,6,Fchangeable period, often cloudy with
OL,7,Frain or showers. Rain likely heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes in the west, but generally
OL,9,Fbecoming drier and brighter through
OL,10,FWednesday.
